                                        "entry_id": "061c140d-5a72-3022-8676-c525cbbca3d7",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Alternative form of road map."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "alt-of",
                                            "alternative"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "22c700d1-79f4-43d7-bd17-56763f04a711",
                                                "sense_id": "5a4aa66d-1e81-3c79-9794-f1e34a3e9a32",
                                                "text": "And our semiconductor industry, I think, is showing the way as to how roadmaps can be used for very general, very generic and very energizing programs of a very broad nature."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "3d44b813-618e-4e06-9bc7-5cd38d4beffa",
                                                "sense_id": "5a4aa66d-1e81-3c79-9794-f1e34a3e9a32",
                                                "text": "In 1966, I could not have imagined my life playing out as it has. That I would do the work I do. Or love the women I loved. My life and work seemed laid out for me, the future a detailed roadmap. The map was wrong."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            },
                            {
                                "target_word": "roadmap",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "3663eed4-d71d-3b00-8268-bb21002f4409",
                                        "entry_id": "2a4144d2-5e30-3155-9ed4-855b0c6fd512",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "To construct a plan of action regarding (something)."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "transitive"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "41250fb0-cdec-4162-a670-fad66bdaa3dc",
                                                "sense_id": "3663eed4-d71d-3b00-8268-bb21002f4409",
                                                "text": "More specifically, we believe that such an approach should be: […] Opportunistic in using available software but also planned when developing new software, with the latter carefully roadmapped."
                                            }
                                        ]
